1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,423
Your little brother is crying on the

2
00:00:03,443 --> 00:00:04,020
sofa.

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:06,022
And you have fourteen words left.

4
00:00:06,613 --> 00:00:08,898
In this world, everyone gets a thousand

5
00:00:08,918 --> 00:00:10,023
words a day.

6
00:00:10,043 --> 00:00:11,813
Spoken or typed.

7
00:00:11,833 --> 00:00:13,818
Use them up, and you're silent until

8
00:00:13,838 --> 00:00:14,988
midnight.

9
00:00:15,277 --> 00:00:17,406
This morning, you had a thousand.

10
00:00:20,457 --> 00:00:21,412
Morning!

11
00:00:21,562 --> 00:00:23,619
Nine hundred and ninety-nine.

12
00:00:24,609 --> 00:00:26,514
Then the group chat starts a war about

13
00:00:26,534 --> 00:00:28,454
pineapple on pizza.

14
00:00:28,474 --> 00:00:30,999
Six hundred words later, you win.

15
00:00:31,189 --> 00:00:33,394
At work, your boss asks for a quick

16
00:00:33,414 --> 00:00:34,141
update.

17
00:00:34,161 --> 00:00:34,761
Quick.

18
00:00:34,781 --> 00:00:36,212
Just the headlines.

19
00:00:36,362 --> 00:00:37,847
It is not quick.

20
00:00:39,137 --> 00:00:41,167
At the café, the barista asks how your

21
00:00:41,187 --> 00:00:42,582
weekend was.

22
00:00:42,602 --> 00:00:43,507
You tell him.

23
00:00:43,527 --> 00:00:44,389
All of it.

24
00:00:44,409 --> 00:00:44,664
Cool.

25
00:00:44,684 --> 00:00:45,544
Oat milk?

26
00:00:45,994 --> 00:00:47,789
By lunch, you have forty-one.

27
00:00:47,809 --> 00:00:49,326
By dinner, fourteen.

28
00:00:49,916 --> 00:00:52,099
And then Theo knocks on your door.

29
00:00:52,119 --> 00:00:53,324
Can I tell you something?

30
00:00:53,344 --> 00:00:54,440
Something real?

31
00:00:56,089 --> 00:00:58,219
Theo has nine hundred and ninety-three

32
00:00:58,239 --> 00:00:59,044
words.

33
00:00:59,064 --> 00:01:00,825
He saved them all day.

34
00:01:00,845 --> 00:01:02,145
I quit the football team.

35
00:01:02,175 --> 00:01:03,170
I didn't tell Mum.

36
00:01:03,190 --> 00:01:04,565
Everyone thinks I'm lazy.

37
00:01:04,605 --> 00:01:05,230
I'm not.

38
00:01:05,250 --> 00:01:07,096
I just hate being bad at it.

39
00:01:07,116 --> 00:01:08,886
Coach said I was the slowest one there.

40
00:01:08,906 --> 00:01:09,882
Everyone laughed.

41
00:01:09,902 --> 00:01:11,067
So I stopped going.

42
00:01:11,087 --> 00:01:12,074
Three weeks ago.

43
00:01:12,224 --> 00:01:13,164
Three weeks.

44
00:01:13,184 --> 00:01:14,478
You didn't notice.

45
00:01:14,498 --> 00:01:16,478
You were busy spending words on people

46
00:01:16,498 --> 00:01:17,812
you'll never meet.

47
00:01:17,832 --> 00:01:20,087
Every sentence you want to say is longer

48
00:01:20,107 --> 00:01:21,853
than fourteen words.

49
00:01:21,873 --> 00:01:23,773
So you don't say any of them.

50
00:01:24,064 --> 00:01:24,944
You nod.

51
00:01:24,964 --> 00:01:26,285
Nods are free.

52
00:01:26,305 --> 00:01:27,816
You think I'm a quitter.

53
00:01:27,966 --> 00:01:29,101
You shake your head.

54
00:01:29,121 --> 00:01:30,392
Also free.

55
00:01:30,982 --> 00:01:32,447
Then your phone buzzes.

56
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:33,513
It's Mum.

57
00:01:33,533 --> 00:01:35,012
Is Theo okay?

58
00:01:35,032 --> 00:01:35,962
she writes.

59
00:01:35,982 --> 00:01:37,204
He's been so quiet.

60
00:01:37,224 --> 00:01:38,774
Typing counts.

61
00:01:38,814 --> 00:01:40,719
One reply could cost you everything

62
00:01:40,739 --> 00:01:41,758
you have left.

63
00:01:41,778 --> 00:01:42,979
You can answer her.

64
00:01:43,018 --> 00:01:44,454
Or you can answer him.

65
00:01:46,104 --> 00:01:47,897
You turn the phone face down.

66
00:01:47,917 --> 00:01:49,572
And you spend six words.

67
00:01:49,592 --> 00:01:50,481
Slowly.

68
00:01:50,501 --> 00:01:51,256
You're not bad.

69
00:01:51,276 --> 00:01:52,378
You're just new.

70
00:01:52,528 --> 00:01:53,577
Eight left.

71
00:01:53,597 --> 00:01:54,344
That's it?

72
00:01:54,364 --> 00:01:55,536
That's enough.

73
00:01:55,686 --> 00:01:56,286
Six.

74
00:01:56,574 --> 00:01:57,674
You grab a pen.

75
00:01:57,694 --> 00:01:59,039
Pictures are free.

76
00:01:59,059 --> 00:02:00,264
A tiny football.

77
00:02:00,284 --> 00:02:01,414
A tiny Theo.

78
00:02:01,434 --> 00:02:02,802
And a giant trophy.

79
00:02:02,822 --> 00:02:04,759
That's not even a real trophy.

80
00:02:04,909 --> 00:02:06,434
But he's smiling.

81
00:02:06,724 --> 00:02:09,029
He talks until his counter runs out.

82
00:02:09,049 --> 00:02:10,845
You listen until midnight.

83
00:02:10,865 --> 00:02:12,755
At twelve, your counter clicks back

84
00:02:12,775 --> 00:02:13,876
to a thousand.

85
00:02:13,896 --> 00:02:14,426
Okay.

86
00:02:14,446 --> 00:02:15,961
Now tell me everything.

87
00:02:16,611 --> 00:02:18,804
What would you say with fourteen words?
